That is impossible in vanilla nethack 3.4.3, with one exception.

Normally the wizard only revives on a 1/6 chance for each "intervention",
and interventions are spaced a minimum of 50 turns apart.

However, the wizard has a separate revive when you enter the Plane of
Earth.  The fact that you happened to kill an Elvenking suggests that is
what happened.

Since that revive is guaranteed, it's actually quite straightforward to
force this to happen.  Get to the top stair with the Amulet and a rubber
chicken, wait there for Rodney, stone him, and then immediately climb.

I guess you need a bit of luck for him to show up before the rubber
chicken rots.

